{"id":"vong-lap-for-while-do-while-xu-ly-vong-lap-long-nhau","chapterId":"chuong-2","chapterNumber":2,"chapterTitle":"ĐIỀU KHIỂN LUỒNG","order":3,"lessonNumber":3,"title":"Vòng lặp For, While, Do-While & Xử lý vòng lặp lồng nhau","wordCount":233,"estimatedMinutes":5,"headings":[{"level":2,"text":"1. Vòng lặp for","id":"1-vong-lap-for"},{"level":2,"text":"2. Vòng lặp while","id":"2-vong-lap-while"},{"level":2,"text":"3. Vòng lặp do-while","id":"3-vong-lap-do-while"},{"level":2,"text":"So sánh nhanh","id":"so-sanh-nhanh"},{"level":2,"text":"4. Vòng lặp lồng nhau (Nested loop)","id":"4-vong-lap-long-nhau-nested-loop"},{"level":2,"text":"5. Lệnh break","id":"5-lenh-break"},{"level":2,"text":"6. Lệnh continue","id":"6-lenh-continue"},{"level":2,"text":"7. Mẹo tối ưu vòng lặp lồng nhau","id":"7-meo-toi-uu-vong-lap-long-nhau"}],"contentHtml":"<h2 id=\"1-vong-lap-for\">1. Vòng lặp for</h2><p>Dùng khi biết trước số lần lặp:</p><pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"tk tk-v\">for</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">(</span><span class=\"tk tk-v\">int</span> i <span class=\"tk tk-t\">=</span> <span class=\"tk tk-n\">0</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span> i <span class=\"tk tk-t\">&lt;</span> n<span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span> i<span class=\"tk tk-t\">++</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">)</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"tk tk-c\">// xử lý</span>\n<span class=\"tk tk-t\">}</span></code></pre><p>Cú pháp tổng quát:</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"monospace\">for</mtext><mtext>&nbsp;</mtext><mtext mathvariant=\"monospace\">(khởi</mtext><mtext>&nbsp;</mtext><mtext mathvariant=\"monospace\">tạo;</mtext><mtext>&nbsp;</mtext><mtext mathvariant=\"monospace\">đi</mtext><mover accent=\"true\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mtext mathvariant=\"monospace\">e</mtext><mo>ˆ</mo></mover><mo>ˋ</mo></mover><mtext mathvariant=\"monospace\">u</mtext><mtext>&nbsp;</mtext><mtext mathvariant=\"monospace\">kiện;</mtext><mtext>&nbsp;</mtext><mtext mathvariant=\"monospace\">bước</mtext><mtext>&nbsp;</mtext><mtext mathvariant=\"monospace\">nhảy)</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\texttt{for (khởi tạo; điều kiện; bước nhảy)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 1.0968em; vertical-align: -0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord texttt\">for&nbsp;(kh</span><span class=\"mord\">ở</span><span class=\"mord texttt\">i&nbsp;t</span><span class=\"mord\">ạ</span><span class=\"mord texttt\">o;&nbsp;</span><span class=\"mord texttt latin_fallback\">đ</span><span class=\"mord texttt\">i</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height: 0.8745em;\"><span style=\"top: -3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height: 3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height: 0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top: -3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height: 3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord texttt\">e</span></span><span style=\"top: -3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height: 3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left: -0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top: -3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height: 3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left: -0.2625em;\"><span class=\"mord texttt\">ˋ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord texttt\">u&nbsp;ki</span><span class=\"mord\">ệ</span><span class=\"mord texttt\">n;&nbsp;b</span><span class=\"mord texttt latin_fallback\">ư</span><span class=\"mord\">ớ</span><span class=\"mord texttt\">c&nbsp;nh</span><span class=\"mord\">ả</span><span class=\"mord texttt\">y)</span></span></span></span></span></span><h2 id=\"2-vong-lap-while\">2. Vòng lặp while</h2><p>Dùng khi <strong>chưa biết trước</strong> số lần lặp, kiểm tra điều kiện <strong>trước</strong> khi thực hiện:</p><pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"ln\">1</span><span class=\"tk tk-v\">int</span> i <span class=\"tk tk-t\">=</span> <span class=\"tk tk-n\">0</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">2</span><span class=\"tk tk-v\">while</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">(</span>i <span class=\"tk tk-t\">&lt;</span> n<span class=\"tk tk-t\">)</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">{</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">3</span>    <span class=\"tk tk-c\">// xử lý</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">4</span>    i<span class=\"tk tk-t\">++</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">5</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">}</span></code></pre><h2 id=\"3-vong-lap-do-while\">3. Vòng lặp do-while</h2><p>Giống <code>while</code> nhưng thực hiện <strong>ít nhất 1 lần</strong> trước khi kiểm tra điều kiện:</p><pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"ln\">1</span><span class=\"tk tk-v\">int</span> i <span class=\"tk tk-t\">=</span> <span class=\"tk tk-n\">0</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">2</span><span class=\"tk tk-v\">do</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">{</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">3</span>    <span class=\"tk tk-c\">// xử lý</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">4</span>    i<span class=\"tk tk-t\">++</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">5</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">}</span> <span class=\"tk tk-v\">while</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">(</span>i <span class=\"tk tk-t\">&lt;</span> n<span class=\"tk tk-t\">)</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span></code></pre><h2 id=\"so-sanh-nhanh\">So sánh nhanh</h2>\n<div class=\"lesson-table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Vòng lặp</th><th>Kiểm tra điều kiện</th><th>Số lần lặp tối thiểu</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>for</code></td><td>Trước</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td><code>while</code></td><td>Trước</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td><code>do-while</code></td><td>Sau</td><td>1</td></tr></tbody></table></div><h2 id=\"4-vong-lap-long-nhau-nested-loop\">4. Vòng lặp lồng nhau (Nested loop)</h2><pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"ln\">1</span><span class=\"tk tk-v\">for</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">(</span><span class=\"tk tk-v\">int</span> i <span class=\"tk tk-t\">=</span> <span class=\"tk tk-n\">0</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span> i <span class=\"tk tk-t\">&lt;</span> n<span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span> i<span class=\"tk tk-t\">++</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">)</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">{</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">2</span>    <span class=\"tk tk-v\">for</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">(</span><span class=\"tk tk-v\">int</span> j <span class=\"tk tk-t\">=</span> <span class=\"tk tk-n\">0</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span> j <span class=\"tk tk-t\">&lt;</span> m<span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span> j<span class=\"tk tk-t\">++</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">)</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">{</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">3</span>        <span class=\"tk tk-c\">// xử lý ô (i, j)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">4</span>    <span class=\"tk tk-t\">}</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">5</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">}</span></code></pre><p>Độ phức tạp vòng lặp lồng đôi:</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n \\times m)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.02778em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>\n<p><strong>Lưu ý:</strong> với <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>≤</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n, m \\le 10^4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 0.8304em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height: 0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top: -3.063em; margin-right: 0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height: 2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>, vòng lặp lồng đôi cho <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>8</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height: 0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top: -3.063em; margin-right: 0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height: 2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">8</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> phép tính — có thể vừa đủ hoặc TLE tùy giới hạn thời gian, cần cân nhắc kỹ.</p><h2 id=\"5-lenh-break\">5. Lệnh break</h2><p>Thoát <strong>ngay lập tức</strong> khỏi vòng lặp gần nhất chứa nó:</p><pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"tk tk-v\">for</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">(</span><span class=\"tk tk-v\">int</span> i <span class=\"tk tk-t\">=</span> <span class=\"tk tk-n\">0</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span> i <span class=\"tk tk-t\">&lt;</span> n<span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span> i<span class=\"tk tk-t\">++</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">)</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"tk tk-v\">if</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">(</span>a<span class=\"tk tk-t\">[</span>i<span class=\"tk tk-t\">]</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">==</span> target<span class=\"tk tk-t\">)</span> <span class=\"tk tk-v\">break</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span>   <span class=\"tk tk-c\">// dừng toàn bộ vòng lặp</span>\n<span class=\"tk tk-t\">}</span></code></pre><p><strong>Lưu ý:</strong> trong vòng lặp lồng nhau, <code>break</code> chỉ thoát vòng lặp <strong>trong cùng</strong>, không thoát vòng lặp ngoài.</p><pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"ln\">1</span><span class=\"tk tk-v\">for</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">(</span><span class=\"tk tk-v\">int</span> i <span class=\"tk tk-t\">=</span> <span class=\"tk tk-n\">0</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span> i <span class=\"tk tk-t\">&lt;</span> n<span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span> i<span class=\"tk tk-t\">++</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">)</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">{</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">2</span>    <span class=\"tk tk-v\">for</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">(</span><span class=\"tk tk-v\">int</span> j <span class=\"tk tk-t\">=</span> <span class=\"tk tk-n\">0</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span> j <span class=\"tk tk-t\">&lt;</span> m<span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span> j<span class=\"tk tk-t\">++</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">)</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">{</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">3</span>        <span class=\"tk tk-v\">if</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">(</span>a<span class=\"tk tk-t\">[</span>i<span class=\"tk tk-t\">]</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">[</span>j<span class=\"tk tk-t\">]</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">==</span> target<span class=\"tk tk-t\">)</span> <span class=\"tk tk-v\">break</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span>   <span class=\"tk tk-c\">// chỉ thoát vòng lặp j</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">4</span>    <span class=\"tk tk-t\">}</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">5</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">}</span></code></pre><h2 id=\"6-lenh-continue\">6. Lệnh <code>continue</code></h2>\n<p>Bỏ qua phần còn lại của lần lặp hiện tại, chuyển sang lần lặp tiếp theo:</p><pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"ln\">1</span><span class=\"tk tk-v\">for</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">(</span><span class=\"tk tk-v\">int</span> i <span class=\"tk tk-t\">=</span> <span class=\"tk tk-n\">0</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span> i <span class=\"tk tk-t\">&lt;</span> n<span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span> i<span class=\"tk tk-t\">++</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">)</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">{</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">2</span>    <span class=\"tk tk-v\">if</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">(</span>a<span class=\"tk tk-t\">[</span>i<span class=\"tk tk-t\">]</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">%</span> <span class=\"tk tk-n\">2</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">!=</span> <span class=\"tk tk-n\">0</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">)</span> <span class=\"tk tk-v\">continue</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span>   <span class=\"tk tk-c\">// bỏ qua số lẻ</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">3</span>    <span class=\"tk tk-c\">// chỉ xử lý số chẵn</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">4</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">}</span></code></pre><h2 id=\"7-meo-toi-uu-vong-lap-long-nhau\">7. Mẹo tối ưu vòng lặp lồng nhau</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Thoát sớm bằng flag</strong> khi cần <code>break</code> cả 2 vòng lặp:</li>\n</ul><pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"ln\">1</span><span class=\"tk tk-v\">bool</span> found <span class=\"tk tk-t\">=</span> <span class=\"tk tk-n\">false</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">2</span><span class=\"tk tk-v\">for</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">(</span><span class=\"tk tk-v\">int</span> i <span class=\"tk tk-t\">=</span> <span class=\"tk tk-n\">0</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span> i <span class=\"tk tk-t\">&lt;</span> n <span class=\"tk tk-t\">&amp;&amp;</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">!</span>found<span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span> i<span class=\"tk tk-t\">++</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">)</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">{</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">3</span>    <span class=\"tk tk-v\">for</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">(</span><span class=\"tk tk-v\">int</span> j <span class=\"tk tk-t\">=</span> <span class=\"tk tk-n\">0</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span> j <span class=\"tk tk-t\">&lt;</span> m<span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span> j<span class=\"tk tk-t\">++</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">)</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">{</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">4</span>        <span class=\"tk tk-v\">if</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">(</span>a<span class=\"tk tk-t\">[</span>i<span class=\"tk tk-t\">]</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">[</span>j<span class=\"tk tk-t\">]</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">==</span> target<span class=\"tk tk-t\">)</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">{</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">5</span>            found <span class=\"tk tk-t\">=</span> <span class=\"tk tk-n\">true</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">6</span>            <span class=\"tk tk-v\">break</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">7</span>        <span class=\"tk tk-t\">}</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">8</span>    <span class=\"tk tk-t\">}</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">9</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">}</span></code></pre><ul>\n<li>Dùng <strong>hàm riêng kèm <code>return</code></strong> để thoát nhiều vòng lặp gọn hơn thay vì dùng nhiều flag.</li>\n<li>Đưa các điều kiện lọc sớm (<code>continue</code>) lên <strong>đầu vòng lặp</strong> để giảm phép tính thừa.</li>\n<li>Với <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span> lớn, ưu tiên giảm độ phức tạp thuật toán thay vì chỉ tối ưu code trong vòng lặp.</li>\n</ul>"}